{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JrZ9QLa9wLcMohzRbAcDXA","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tResearch complete. Every Ch 2–18 section shipped exactly as the skeleton planned, so all cross-bearing targets resolve. Three findings changed the plan: the canonical theme-3 phrase, the Ch 1 Bearings precedent (3+2, not 2×5), and a missing book-level artifact that §5 depends on.\n2\t\n3\t---\n4\t\n5\t```yaml\n6\t---\n7\tchapter: 19\n8\tchapter_type: \"synthesis\"\n9\ttitle: \"Bearings Before Landfall\"\n10\tsubtitle: \"Everything that connects, and the traps that don't\"\n11\texam_domain: \"All four domains — synthesis, no new objectives\"\n12\tdomain_weight_pct: 0\n13\tcomplexity: \"mixed\"\n14\tnovelty: \"familiar\"\n15\tprereq_factor: \"heavy\"\n16\t\n17\t# --- Section plan (no word budgets) ---\n18\t# Section numbers are BINDING. §3 and §5 are pinned by published cross-bearings\n19\t# already shipped in chapter-01-taking-departure.md (lines 215 and 452).\n20\tsections:\n21\t  - name: \"Nine Threads Through Twenty Chapters\"\n22\t    objectives: [\"D1.1\", \"D1.2\", \"D1.3\", \"D1.4\", \"D2.1\", \"D2.2\", \"D2.3\", \"D2.4\", \"D3.1\", \"D3.2\", \"D4.1\", \"D4.2\", \"D4.3\"]\n23\t    requires_figure: true\n24\t    figure_anchor: \"ch19-fig01-cross-domain-integration-map\"\n25\t    checkpoint_after: true\n26\t  - name: \"The Pairs That Cost Points\"\n27\t    objectives: [\"D1.1\", \"D1.2\", \"D1.3\", \"D1.4\", \"D2.1\", \"D2.2\", \"D2.3\", \"D2.4\", \"D3.1\", \"D3.2\", \"D4.1\", \"D4.2\", \"D4.3\"]\n28\t    requires_figure: true\n29\t    figure_anchor: \"ch19-fig02-confusion-pair-matrix\"\n30\t    checkpoint_after: true\n31\t  - name: \"Ninety Minutes\"\n32\t    objectives: []\n33\t    requires_figure: true\n34\t    figure_anchor: \"ch19-fig03-exam-day-pacing\"\n35\t    checkpoint_after: false\n36\t  - name: \"Where the Weight Actually Is\"\n37\t    objectives: []\n38\t    requires_figure: false\n39\t    figure_anchor: null\n40\t   